{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "...Yagami-san. I know I said was scared, and truthfully,\nI still am. But you know what?": "",
  "I'm gonna get back on my feet and keep going... No matter\nwhat happens!": "",
  "...Good.": "",
  "So, everyone. I'd like to ask you... From here on out, I'll\nbe giving it my all, so please! Keep cheering me on!": "",
  "That's exactly what I plan to do.": "",
  "Same here!": "",
  "(I was never serious about her paying me back when she's successful...)": "",
  "(But who knows? At this rate, maybe she'll end up famous enough to make good on the deal. Ha.)": "",
  "(Hopefully by then, she'll be on TV and living a life of luxury... Far away from me and this place.)": "",
  "(Damn. I'm too poor to be buying music...)": "",
  "(All right. Now I can eavesdrop without being caught.)": "",
  "(...No, Saito's investigation takes priority. I can't leave yet.)": "",
  "(She's popular, good at singing, and she's got luck... Maybe she's the real deal.)": "",
  "(...Maybe I'll ask her about how the talk with the agency went.)": "",
  "I'm so scared...!": "",
  "Ahhhhhh!": "",
  "Hmm? What the hell is this?": "",
  "Uh oh!": "",
  "Th-That's my hat! Give it back!": "",
  "Oh yeah? Hahahaha!": "",
  "Ahahahahaha!": "",
  "What!? No! Hey! Help, Yagami-san!": "",
  "(I guess I better chase him down...)": "",
  "*huff* *huff* You're pretty fast, mister!": "",
  "Yeah... I am. Now give it back.": "",
  "Tch, finders keepers, man!": "",
  "You little brat! Give it back, unless you want me to hunt you to the ends of the earth!": "",
  "Holy crap!": "",
  "Hmph. Kids will be kids, eh, Yagami-san? I'll let this little incident just fly away on the breeze.": "",
  "The goddess of the sun won't smile down on me if I let life's trivial matters bother me, right?": "",
  "(Annnnd here comes the complete personality shift.)": "",
  "Have you ever considered finding a way to make sure it doesn't blow away, though?": "",
  "Pish posh, Yagami-san. The lady of the north wind is a fickle sort, you know.": "",
  "And who am I to try to predict the whimsy of such a woman? Hahaha.": "",
  "Yagami-san. Here, why don't you take this?": "",
  "Hm? What's that? Oh, I do believe the breeze is whispering my name.": "",
  "I feel the muses on the wind... Perhaps I shall compose a poem to accompany this delightful little ditty.": "",
  "We shall meet again! Ha ha...": "",
  "(He's more like a typhoon than a breeze...)": "",
  "(That was Tokunaga-san's \"hat\", right? It's loose again...)": "",
  "It is Tokunaga-san's hat.": "",
  "Woah!": "",
  "Ugh. Ouuuch...": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san? Don't worry about me...! Get my hat, please!": "",
  "(Not again...)": "",
  "Oh. Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hm? ...What happened to your \"hat,\" Tokunaga-san?": "",
  "Ergh... It flew away again, actually.": "",
  "But aren't you holding it?": "",
  "Nope. This one isn't mine.": "",
  "Mine is... over there.": "",
  "Huh? I think you better fill me in.": "",
  "So, my hat was swept away by the breeze like always...": "",
  "But as it happens, someone else lost their hat in the breeze too, but he seems to have retrieved mine by mistake.": "",
  "Ugh. I'm at a loss...": "",
  "Couldn't you just... ask him to trade?": "",
  "That's not something you can just ask a guy to do, Yagami-san. Besides... He's scary-looking.": "",
  "Well, I'm sure he could take it the wrong way if you went up and asked about a \"hat.\"": "",
  "Right? Worst case scenario, a guy like that might even punch me.": "",
  "So Yagami-san... I need your help on this one! Please, get my hat back!": "",
  "If that's how it's gotta be...": "",
  "(This is a pretty delicate matter, so I should probably approach him when nobody else is around.)": "",
  "(Man, even I don't feel comfortable going up and asking him. How do I even approach this?)": "",
  "(Maybe this is my chance...!)": "",
  "All right, nabbed it!": "",
  "Hey, you! That's mine!": "",
  "Actually, there's been a misunderstanding...": "",
  "Shut up! I can't even walk out the door without that! Give it back, you sonuvabitch!": "",
  "Shit! *huff* *huff* Just give it back man... It's important to me...": "",
  "I was trying to tell you, there's been a misunderstanding!": "",
  "What do you mean!?": "",
  "This is your wig.": "",
  "The wind somehow managed to pick up two wigs at the same time, and you grabbed the wrong one.": "",
  "...I-I see. Then...": "",
  "You're like me, then?": "",
  "No, I'm working for—": "",
  "Well, why didn't you just say so, bro? You're one of us!": "",
  "What? No. I'm—": "",
  "You even rock a black wig and a blonde wig on different days?": "",
  "You've got mad style, bro.": "",
  "...Can we trade wigs or not?": "",
  "Oh yeah, sure thing, my brother of the bald.": "",
  "See you around!": "",
  "(What matters is that I got it back, so... whatever.)": "",
  "Wow, I saw that whole thing. You're a beast, but...": "",
  "I didn't know you wore a hat too.": "",
  "No, I told you, I don't.": "",
  "It's pretty lame to hide it, man. You can trick people all you want, but the sun and the moon see all.": "",
  "I don't like where this is going...": "",
  "Here's your fee, Yagami-san. You earned it.": "",
  "Thanks as always.": "",
  "Oh yeah, did I mention? I've got some good news to share.": "",
  "From a barren wasteland, the hope of new life has been given breath.": "",
  "Wait... You mean...": "",
  "Exactly. It's only one for now, but my efforts seem to be paying off.": "",
  "Look at it, man. It's playing with the breeze.": "",
  "Congratulations!": "",
  "Having something to protect makes a man stronger. And I have to protect this... no matter what.": "",
  "(Tokunaga-san sure seems happy...)": "",
  "Yagami-san. Thank you. I'll be counting on your continued support!": "",
  "Here's your reward. It's all you.": "",
  "So long! The breeze is calling out to me!": "",
  "(...That is one strange dude.)": "",
  "We go now to our story on Tatsuya Gamo, the escaped convict from Hokkaido's Abashiri Prison.": "",
  "Convicted of murdering a member of a criminal organization three years ago, Gamo's sentence had only just begun.": "",
  "However, police are calling for caution after he was found to have escaped at dawn on the fifth of last month.": "",
  "According to reports released by Tokyo PD today, there is reason to believe he may be sheltering in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Authorities are asking that any sightings of Gamo be reported immediately and urging citizens to take precautions.": "",
  "It's worth noting that there is a 1,200,000 yen reward for info that leads to his capture.": "",
  "(Yikes. Another day in the life here in Kamurocho, huh? Would suck to run into that guy.)": "",
  "(But for a reward that big? Probably worth keeping an eye out, at least.)": "",
  "(Hey, that guy...)": "",
  "(Isn't he the fugitive I saw on the news?)": "",
  "I've got you now, Gamo.": "",
  "The hell do ya want? Can't ya see I'm trying to enjoy a burger here?": "",
  "Haven't you heard? There's a bounty on your head! 1,200,000 yen!": "",
  "Tch, that all? I'm offended.": "",
  "Tough talk for criminal scum like you! Now die!": "",
  "(Whoa, that guy didn't even stand a chance...)": "",
  "Ya wouldn't be thinkin' 'bout callin' the cops now, would ya?": "",
  "N-No, of course not!": "",
  "Nighty-night, pal.": "",
  "Damn, can't a guy enjoy a meal in peace?": "",
  "You got somethin' to say?": "",
  "Me? Uh, no?": "",
  "You after that pitiful reward too? Don't think it'd be wise to get between me and this burger, if ya are.": "",
  "Well, I couldn't call myself a law-abiding citizen if I ignored you.": "",
  "Besides, I'm sure the cops'll give you a pork katsu bowl if you ask nice.": "",
  "I'm over pork katsu. I want a burger.": "",
  "Sounds like we're at an impasse.": "",
  "If ya wanna bring me in so bad... You'll have to do it by force!": "",
  "What the hell? You got some spunk, pal.": "",
  "D-Damn...": "",
  "Stayin' conscious after I knock ya down ain't no easy feat. What's your name?": "",
  "Yagami. I'll remember that name.": "",
  "Haha, sounds like a fun game of cat and mouse! Now if you'll excuse me, I've got a burger craving.": "",
  "(That guy's no pushover... I better make sure I'm really ready to face him, or I'm gonna end up dead.)": "",
  "(Next time he's going down!)": "",
  "Hey, we meet again.": "",
  "Persistent, ain't ya?": "",
  "Yeah well, the reward's fine and all, but now it's personal.": "",
  "Try all ya want, the results'll be the same. You gettin' crushed, that is!": "",
  "(Damn, I lost again... Next time, Gamo!)": "",
  "Oof... Now stop... struggling.": "",
  "Holy hell... I can't believe I just lost a fist fight...": "",
  "Maybe you were on top at some point, but there's always someone who's going to be better.": "",
  "Hello, police? I've got an update on that escaped prisoner for you.": "",
  "Gamo. You've given us the slip for longer than we care to admit. But it's time to give up.": "",
  "Sorry, officer. I just had a burger craving, and nobody does 'em like Tokyo.": "",
  "It wasn't easy... But at least I got a good fight out of it. I think I can go satisfied.": "",
  "You're welcome.": "",
  "Besides, at least now I'll eat my meals in peace.": "",
  "Yeah well, I wouldn't expect burgers in the interrogation room.": "",
  "If not, I'm expectin' a care package with your name as the sender! Hahah! Later!": "",
  "You've really taken a liking to this place?": "",
  "But I don't think you're the type to call the cops on me. You want that bounty.": "",
  "Maybe. Or maybe I just don't like losing. You ready?": "",
  "Yeah. I'll play as much you want. But I'll crush you this time!": "",
  "I figure this is as good a spot as any to lay low in, so if you want a rematch, I'll be down anytime.": "",
  "Yeah? Tell me where you'll be, then.": "",
  "I'm on the run, fool. I can't be walkin' around in broad daylight.": "",
  "Maybe I'll find some back alley to nap in.": "",
  "Fine. I know this city inside out, and I'll find you, no matter where you hide.": "",
  "Thanks for waiting, Shimazu-san.": "",
  "Oh, this is Hasegawa-san, the landlord here.": "",
  "You're a stubborn one, Shimazu-san. I told you a thousand times, there's no ghost here.": "",
  "That's why I've called in a professional to verify it.": "",
  "Oh great, you some kinda spirit medium?": "",
  "No. I'm Yagami, a detective.": "",
  "Nice. A detective. That's fine. Can you clear up these \"ghost\" shenanigans once and for all, then? ": "",
  "You know what they say. Every dog has a wolf's shadow.": "",
  "Just to be clear, there's never been any incidents in the room, such as an accidental death?": "",
  "Nope. No way. This property is totally renovated, and the lot was empty before it got built.": "",
  "I wouldn't even justify these outrageous claims with an investigation.": "",
  "Well, let me see what I can find out, and I'll let you know when I'm done.": "",
  "You detectives always find yourself contracting to kooks? All the same, here's the keys. Good luck tonight.": "",
  "...Thanks.": "",
  "I turned on the electricity and water for you, too.": "",
  "I'm not particularly motivated here... But I guess I should sweep the room.": "",
  "...Nothing here. Pretty normal for a vacant apartment.": "",
  "(Not much else to do, so I guess I'll check the room.)": "",
  "(Ghosts, huh? What was that about a dog's shadow and wolves? Hm.)": "",
  "The windows are shut and locked...": "",
  "I guess that rules that out.": "",
  "Hm, the water's apparently on, because it's wet here. Even got some buildup...": "",
  "That would mean it's getting some good use, I suppose.": "",
  "And the front door should have been locked before the landlord opened it.": "",
  "Why would anyone trespass in here before people moved in? A squatter, maybe?": "",
  "Hm? What's this...?": "",
  "A woman's earring? What's this doing here?": "",
  "An earring and signs someone was using the water... What's the link?": "",
  "Hmm. Kind of inconclusive.": "",
  "...Pretty bored. Nothing to do but talk to myself and play the guessing game.": "",
  "(...Hm? What was that?)": "",
  "......Huh?": "",
  "Was that...!? No way that was a ghost... right? It had legs!": "",
  "...No time like the present to chase it down!": "",
  "*huff* *huff* Wh-Who are you!?": "",
  "I'm a detective. What were you doing in that room?": "",
  "This is your earring, right? Did you even realize you'd dropped it?": "",
  "I suggest you start talking. Or I could always call the police on you for trespassing.": "",
  "...Hmph. Ever heard the saying, \"Dead men tell no tales\"?": "",
  "Fine. You don't want to talk.": "",
  "(I should probably bring Shimazu-san and the landlord into this.)": "",
  "Hello? What's going on, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Apologies for calling so late, but I caught it. The \"ghost.\"": "",
  "Huh!? So it really was haunted!? W-Wait... You caught it!?": "",
  "Yeah. But it won't talk.": "",
  "I'm sorry to ask, but can you come down here? And call your landlord too?": "",
  "Okay! We'll be there as soon as possible!": "",
  "Yagami-san!? Is that the ghost?": "",
  "My, my. Since when did ghosts start walking on perfectly corporeal legs?": "",
  "Er...": "",
  "...Huh? ...Is that you, Yukako?": "",
  "Yukako? You know her?": "",
  "She's my girlfriend! The one who's supposed to be in Akita!": "",
  "But...! Her hair...": "",
  "You idiot. It's a wig.": "",
  "Yukako! What... What were you thinking!?": "",
  "Yukako-san... I think it's time to come clean, wouldn't you agree?": "",
  "...It's because the room is too expensive.": "",
  "If we could prove it was haunted, we could get a lower price, right?": "",
  "...Don't tell me that's why you did this.": "",
  "Afraid so. My darling Mamoru... I just wanted to help ease the burden of looking after me.": "",
  "So I came to the city a little earlier than we'd planned.": "",
  "I'm kind of lost for words. You did all that work just to... For this?": "",
  "Y-Yukako... You...": "",
  "You did all of this for me? What a wonderful girl! My little melon pie!": "",
  "Mamoru...! My dashing sweet! I would <font_kind=yakuza_italic>die</font_kind> for you!": "",
  "Y-Yukako! I love you, my sugar plum! I will love you until death do us part!": "",
  "No! Our love will endure beyond that! Not even death can tear us apart!": "",
  "Okay you two. I'd say get a room, but that's the crux of the problem, isn't it? How'd you get the key, anyway?": "",
  "I saw the landlord hide it under the gas meter in the hallway, so I got a duplicate made.": "",
  "Oh... I guess that's usually where you put it before people move in.": "",
  "...Shimazu-san. You really had no part in this?": "",
  "He didn't! I didn't tell my love about the plan, but I never imagined he would hire a detective.": "",
  "You should have told me, baby.": "",
  "But... I didn't want you to get wrapped up in this!": "",
  "Yukako! My strawberry shortcake! I had no idea you were being so considerate of me!": "",
  "Uh... Guys, I don't mean to interrupt this tender moment, but you've gotta consider something...": "",
  "Your lease hadn't started yet, so technically this is trespassing.": "",
  "...That's why I didn't want to get you involved, my beloved!": "",
  "I guess it's really up to your landlord at this point...": "",
  "...Hasegawa-san?": "",
  "W-What is wrong with you two!? Are you both insane!?": "",
  "No... But we're insanely in love!": "",
  "The only thing that's insane here is the world! The market price for rent should never have gotten this high!": "",
  "...Shimazu-san, I won't sue you. But all the same... No way I'm renting you that room.": "",
  "Huh? But the contract...": "",
  "To hell with the contract! You tried to scam me into thinking an accident happened, and then you hired a detective!": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "...Good.": "...ดีแล้ว",
  "Same here!": "เช่นกันนะ!",
  "Ahhhhhh!": "อ๊ากกกก!",
  "Ahahahahaha!": "ฮ่าฮ่าฮ่าฮ่าฮ่า!",
  "What do you mean!?": "แกหมายความว่าอะไร!?",
  "See you around!": "แล้วเจอกันนะ!",
  "Congratulations!": "ยินดีด้วยนะ!",
  "D-Damn...": "เ-เวร...",
  "You're welcome.": "ไม่เป็นไรจ้ะ",
  "...Thanks.": "...ขอบคุณนะ",
  "Hm? What's this...?": "อืม? นี่อะไรกัน...?",
  "Er...": "เอ่อ..."
 }
}
